# Machine-managed files: collapsed in PR diffs, excluded from language stats.
#
# rules_lint's format multirun SKIPS every file with `linguist-generated`,
# `gitlab-generated` or `rules-lint-ignored` set, so nothing meant to be
# formatted may be listed here. Anchor every pattern with a leading `/`: a bare
# name matches that basename at EVERY depth and would hide those files from the
# formatter. BUILD.bazel and MODULE.bazel are hand-written and stay formatted.
/MODULE.bazel.lock linguist-generated=true
/maven_install.json linguist-generated=true
/api/baseline.binpb binary linguist-generated=true
